GAME RUN INSTRUCTIONS
===

1. To run the game
    * Make sure you have the "music.mp3" file installed.
    * Make sure the "music.mp3" file is located in the data folder.
    * Once those two steps are complete all you need to do is run the code.

2. Features
    * Pixel-Art Environment
    * Animated Fisherman
    * Fishing Mechanics
    * Fishing Mini-Game
    * Multiple Fish Types
    * Scoring System
    * Player Statistics
    * Background Music

3. Controls

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| Left Arrow | Wind Up Fishing Rod |
| Right Arrow | Cast Fishing Rod |
| Up Arrow | Bounce Yellow Marker |

**Objective**: Keep the yellow marker inside the green fish indicator to increase your score. Reach the target score to catch a fish.

4. Fishing Types and Rewards

| Fish | Rate | Reward 
| --- | --- | --- 
| Bass | 50% | $10
| Carp | 30% | $20
| Trout | 20% | $50

